" validation cycle around `v0.12.0`. Use the current `vllm-ascend` "
"documentation image placeholder or a later release for the examples below."
msgstr ""
"`Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct` 教程在 vLLM-Ascend 验证周期中于 `v0.12.0` 版本左右引入。请使用当前 "
"`vllm-ascend` 文档镜像占位符或更高版本运行以下示例。"

