#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:304
#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:560
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If you encounter issues, please refer to the [Public "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html) for "
"troubleshooting."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果遇到问题，请参考[公共FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)进行排查。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:306
msgid "**Key parameters:**"
msgstr "**关键参数：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:308
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size 4` and `--tensor-parallel-size 4` map the 16 NPUs on "
"one A3 node into four DP groups, each with TP4."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size 4`和`--tensor-parallel-size "
"4`将单个A3节点上的16个NPU映射为四个DP组，每组采用TP4。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:309
msgid ""
"`--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not"
" mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer."
msgstr "`--enable-expert-parallel`启用MoE层的专家并行。请勿在同一MoE层中混合使用MoE张量并行和专家并行。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:310
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len` is the maximum input plus output length for a single "
"request. Multimodal inputs consume text tokens and visual tokens, so "
"increase it only when enough KV cache is available."
msgstr ""
"`--max-model-len`是单个请求的最大输入加输出长度。多模态输入会消耗文本token和视觉token，因此仅在KV缓存充足时增加该值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:311
msgid ""
"`--max-num-seqs` is the maximum number of active requests scheduled by each "
"DP group. For performance tests, set `--max-num-seqs * --data-parallel-size`"
" greater than or equal to the test concurrency."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-seqs`是每个DP组调度的最大活跃请求数。性能测试时，请确保`--max-num-seqs * --data-parallel-"
"size`大于或等于测试并发数。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:312
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one "
"scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes "
"more activation memory."
msgstr ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens`是单个调度步骤中处理的最大token数。较大的值可提升prefill效率，但会消耗更多激活内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:313
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` controls how much HBM vLLM can use to calculate "
"KV cache capacity. A higher value increases KV cache size but can trigger "
"OOM if runtime memory is higher than the profile run."
msgstr ""
"`--gpu-memory-"
"utilization`控制vLLM可用于计算KV缓存容量的HBM比例。较高的值会增加KV缓存大小，但如果运行时内存高于profile运行值，可能触发OOM。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:314
msgid ""
"`--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W8A8 model. "
"Remove this option when deploying the BF16 model."
msgstr "`--quantization ascend`为W8A8模型启用Ascend量化。部署BF16模型时请移除该选项。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:315
msgid ""
"`--limit-mm-per-prompt.image 1` and `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0` reserve "
"multimodal capacity for one image per request and disable video inputs to "
"save memory."
msgstr ""
"`--limit-mm-per-prompt.image 1`和`--limit-mm-per-prompt.video "
"0`为每个请求预留一张图像的多模态容量，并禁用视频输入以节省内存。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:316
msgid ""
"`--mm-processor-cache-gb 0` disables the multimodal processor cache. "
"Increase it only when your workload benefits from reused media preprocessing"
" and you have enough host memory."
msgstr ""
"`--mm-processor-cache-gb 0`禁用多模态处理器缓存。仅当工作负载受益于重复的媒体预处理且主机内存充足时，才增加该值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:317
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables "
"full decode ACLGraph replay to reduce dispatch overhead."
msgstr ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 启用完整解码 "
"ACLGraph 重放以减少调度开销。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:319
msgid "5.2 Multi-Node Deployment with MP (Recommended for BF16)"
msgstr "5.2 多节点 MP 部署（BF16 推荐）"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:321
msgid ""
"Multi-node MP deployment uses vLLM data parallelism across nodes and tensor "
"parallelism within each node. It is recommended for the BF16 model on 2 "
"Atlas 800 A2 (64G x 8) nodes, or for long-context validation where one node "
"does not provide enough HBM headroom."
msgstr ""
"多节点 MP 部署在节点间使用 vLLM 数据并行，在节点内使用张量并行。推荐在 2 个 Atlas 800 A2（64G x 8）节点上部署 BF16"
" 模型，或用于单个节点 HBM 空间不足的长上下文验证场景。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:323
msgid ""
"Assume you have 2 Atlas 800 A2 nodes and want to deploy "
"`Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct-w8a8-QuaRot` across them. Replace `nic_name`, "
"`local_ip`, and `node0_ip` with the actual network interface and IP "
"addresses in your environment."
msgstr ""
"假设您有 2 个 Atlas 800 A2 节点，并希望跨节点部署 "
"`Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct-w8a8-QuaRot`。请将 `nic_name`、`local_ip` 和 "
"`node0_ip` 替换为实际环境中的网络接口和 IP 地址。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:325
msgid "Run the following script on node 0."
msgstr "在节点 0 上运行以下脚本。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:374
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If node 1 cannot join the service or HCCL initialization "
"times out, refer to [verify multi-node communication "
"environment](../../installation.md#verify-multi-node-communication) and "
"[Public FAQs](../../faqs.md). Make sure the network interface names, IP "
"addresses, and RPC ports are consistent across nodes."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果节点 1 无法加入服务或 HCCL "
"初始化超时，请参考[验证多节点通信环境](../../installation.md#verify-multi-node-"
"communication)和[常见问题解答](../../faqs.md)。确保各节点的网络接口名称、IP 地址和 RPC 端口一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:376
msgid "Run the following script on node 1."
msgstr "在节点 1 上运行以下脚本。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:429
msgid ""
"If the service starts successfully, the following information is displayed "
"on node 0:"
msgstr "如果服务启动成功，节点 0 上将显示以下信息："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:440
msgid "**Key parameters for MP deployment:**"
msgstr "**MP 部署的关键参数：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:442
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size` is the global DP size across all nodes. In the "
"example, 2 DP ranks are used."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-size` 是所有节点的全局 DP 大小。示例中使用了 2 个 DP rank。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:443
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local` is the number of DP ranks on the current node. "
"In the example, each A2 node has 1 local DP rank."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-size-local` 是当前节点上的 DP rank 数量。示例中每个 A2 节点有 1 个本地 DP rank。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:444
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank` is the first DP rank on the current node. Node "
"0 starts from 0 by default, and node 1 starts from 1."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-start-rank` 是当前节点的起始 DP rank。节点 0 默认从 0 开始，节点 1 从 1 开始。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:445
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-address` must point to the master DP node. Use node 0 "
"`local_ip` on node 0 and `node0_ip` on other nodes."
msgstr ""
"`--data-parallel-address` 必须指向主 DP 节点。在节点 0 上使用节点 0 的 `local_ip`，在其他节点上使用 "
"`node0_ip`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:446
msgid ""
"`--data-parallel-rpc-port` is the DP RPC port. Use the same value on all "
"nodes and ensure the port is available."
msgstr "`--data-parallel-rpc-port` 是 DP RPC 端口。在所有节点上使用相同的值，并确保端口可用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:447
msgid ""
"`--api-server-count` controls how many API server processes are started on "
"the master node."
msgstr "`--api-server-count` 控制主节点上启动的 API 服务器进程数量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:448
msgid ""
"`--headless` starts a worker node without exposing an API server. Use it on "
"non-master nodes."
msgstr "`--headless` 启动一个不暴露 API 服务器的工作节点。在非主节点上使用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:449
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 8` maps one TP group to the 8 NPUs on each A2 node."
msgstr "`--tensor-parallel-size 8` 将一个 TP 组映射到每个 A2 节点上的 8 个 NPU。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:450
msgid ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, and "
"`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` bind HCCL, Gloo, and TP communication to the selected "
"network."
msgstr ""
"`HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME` 和 `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` "
"将 HCCL、Gloo 和 TP 通信绑定到所选网络。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:452
msgid "5.3 Multi-Node PD Separation Deployment"
msgstr "5.3 多节点 PD 分离部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:454
msgid ""
"PD disaggregation separates Prefill and Decode into different service "
"groups. Prefill nodes process large prompt chunks, Decode nodes serve token "
"generation, and a proxy forwards requests between them. This mode is "
"suitable for production serving scenarios where prefill and decode resource "
"ratios need to be tuned separately."
msgstr ""
"PD 分离将 Prefill 和 Decode 划分为不同的服务组。Prefill 节点处理大型提示块，Decode 节点负责 token "
"生成，代理在两者之间转发请求。此模式适用于需要分别调整 Prefill 和 Decode 资源比例的生产服务场景。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:456
msgid ""
"We recommend using Mooncake for deployment. Refer to "
"[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md) for the "
"general PD disaggregation workflow and request forwarding setup."
msgstr ""
"我们推荐使用 Mooncake 进行部署。有关通用 PD 分离工作流和请求转发设置，请参考 "
"[Mooncake](../features/pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:458
msgid ""
"The following example matches the validated A3 two-node topology for "
"`Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct-w8a8-QuaRot`:"
msgstr "以下示例与已验证的 `Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct-w8a8-QuaRot` A3 双节点拓扑匹配："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:460
msgid "1 Prefill node: 1 Atlas 800 A3 (64G x 16), DP2 + TP8 + EP."
msgstr "1 个 Prefill 节点：1 个 Atlas 800 A3（64G x 16），DP2 + TP8 + EP。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:461
msgid ""
"1 Decode node: 1 Atlas 800 A3 (64G x 16), DP4 + TP4 + EP + full decode "
"ACLGraph."
msgstr ""
"1 个 Decode 节点：1 个 Atlas 800 A3（64G x 16），DP4 + TP4 + EP + 完整解码 ACLGraph。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:463
msgid "5.3.1 Prefill Node"
msgstr "5.3.1 Prefill 节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:465
msgid "Create `run_p.sh` on the prefill node."
msgstr "在 prefill 节点上创建 `run_p.sh`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:505
msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If the prefill service is not ready for a long time, "
"check whether the model path is shared, all 16 NPUs are visible, and the "
"Mooncake `kv_port` is available."
msgstr ""
"常见问题提示：如果 prefill 服务长时间未就绪，请检查模型路径是否共享、所有 16 个 NPU 是否可见以及 Mooncake `kv_port`"
" 是否可用。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:507
msgid "5.3.2 Decode Node"
msgstr "5.3.2 Decode 节点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:509
msgid "Create `run_d.sh` on the decode node."
msgstr "在 decode 节点上创建 `run_d.sh`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:550
msgid "**Key parameters for PD disaggregation:**"
msgstr "**PD 分离的关键参数：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:552
msgid ""
"Prefill uses `--data-parallel-size 2`, `--data-parallel-size-local 2`, and "
"`--tensor-parallel-size 8`."
msgstr ""
"Prefill 使用 `--data-parallel-size 2`、`--data-parallel-size-local 2` 和 "
"`--tensor-parallel-size 8`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:553
msgid ""
"Decode uses `--data-parallel-size 4`, `--data-parallel-size-local 4`, and "
"`--tensor-parallel-size 4`."
msgstr ""
"Decode 使用 `--data-parallel-size 4`、`--data-parallel-size-local 4` 和 "
"`--tensor-parallel-size 4`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:554
msgid ""
"`--max-num-batched-tokens` is set to 8192 on both sides in this validation "
"topology. Increase the prefill value only if activation memory is "
"sufficient."
msgstr ""
"在此验证拓扑中，两侧的 `--max-num-batched-tokens` 均设置为 8192。仅在激活内存充足时增加 prefill 的值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:555
msgid ""
"`--kv-transfer-config` sets the Mooncake connector. `kv_role` is "
"`kv_producer` on prefill and `kv_consumer` on decode."
msgstr ""
"`--kv-transfer-config` 设置 Mooncake 连接器。`kv_role` 在 prefill 上为 "
"`kv_producer`，在 decode 上为 `kv_consumer`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:556
msgid ""
"`kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and "
"`decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout."
msgstr ""
"`kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 "
"`decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与实际全局 DP 和 TP 布局匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:557
msgid ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching` disables prefix caching. For PD disaggregation,"
" first validate the service without prefix caching before enabling "
"additional cache features."
msgstr ""
"`--no-enable-prefix-caching` 禁用前缀缓存。对于 PD 分离，请先在不启用前缀缓存的情况下验证服务，然后再启用其他缓存功能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:558
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` is "
"recommended on decode nodes to reduce decode dispatch overhead."
msgstr ""
"建议在 decode 节点上使用 `--compilation-config "
"'{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` 以减少解码调度开销。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:562
msgid "Service Verification:"
msgstr "服务验证："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:580
msgid "Expected Result:"
msgstr "预期结果："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:582
msgid ""
"The service returns HTTP 200 OK with a JSON response containing the "
"`choices` field."
msgstr "服务返回 HTTP 200 OK，JSON 响应中包含 `choices` 字段。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:584
msgid "6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "6 功能验证"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:586
msgid ""
"After the server is started, send a request to verify basic multimodal "
"functionality. For single-node and MP deployment, use the API endpoint on "
"node 0. For PD disaggregation, use the proxy endpoint from the Mooncake "
"deployment guide."
msgstr ""
"服务器启动后，发送请求以验证基本多模态功能。对于单节点和 MP 部署，使用节点 0 上的 API 端点。对于 PD 分离，使用 Mooncake "
"部署指南中的代理端点。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:605
msgid ""
"Expected result: the HTTP status is 200 and the JSON response contains a "
"`choices` field with generated text, for example text similar to `TONGYI "
"Qwen`."
msgstr ""
"预期结果：HTTP 状态为 200，JSON 响应包含带有生成文本的 `choices` 字段，例如类似于 `TONGYI Qwen` 的文本。"

