msgstr "`serve`：对在线服务吞吐量进行基准测试。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:634
msgid "`throughput`: benchmark offline inference throughput."
msgstr "`throughput`：对离线推理吞吐量进行基准测试。"

