#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:712
msgid "10 FAQ"
msgstr "10 常见问题"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:714
msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, refer to"
" [Public FAQs](../../faqs.md). This section only covers model-specific "
"issues for Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct."
msgstr ""
"关于常见环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参考[公共常见问题](../../faqs.md)。本节仅涵盖 "
"Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct 的模型特定问题。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:716
msgid ""
"Q1: Why does the service report OOM during startup or soon after accepting "
"requests?"
msgstr "Q1：为什么服务在启动时或刚接受请求后报告 OOM？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:718
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** The service fails during profile run, or it starts "
"successfully but reports OOM when real traffic arrives."
msgstr "**现象：** 服务在 profile 运行期间失败，或者成功启动但在真实流量到达时报告 OOM。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:720
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct has high weight, KV cache, and "
"multimodal preprocessing memory requirements. Large `--max-model-len`, large"
" `--max-num-seqs`, large `--max-num-batched-tokens`, high image resolution, "
"too many images per prompt, or high `--gpu-memory-utilization` can leave "
"insufficient HBM headroom."
msgstr ""
"**原因：** Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct 对权重、KV 缓存和多模态预处理内存需求较高。较大的 `--max-model-"
"len`、`--max-num-seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens`、高图像分辨率、每个提示中图像过多或较高的 "
"`--gpu-memory-utilization` 可能导致 HBM 余量不足。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:722
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Use the W8A8 model with `--quantization ascend` when possible,"
" lower `--max-model-len`, lower `--max-num-seqs`, lower `--max-num-batched-"
"tokens`, lower image/video limits, or reduce `--gpu-memory-utilization`. "
"Keep `PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True`."
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 尽可能使用带 `--quantization ascend` 的 W8A8 模型，降低 `--max-model-"
"len`、`--max-num-seqs`、`--max-num-batched-tokens`，降低图像/视频限制，或减小 `--gpu-"
"memory-utilization`。保持 `PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True`。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:724
msgid "Q2: Why does multi-node MP deployment hang during initialization?"
msgstr "Q2：为什么多节点 MP 部署在初始化期间挂起？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:726
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** One node waits for other ranks, HCCL initialization times "
"out, or the headless node exits."
msgstr "**现象：** 一个节点等待其他 rank，HCCL 初始化超时，或无头节点退出。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:728
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Network interface names, IP addresses, DP ranks, or RPC ports are"
" inconsistent across nodes."
msgstr "**原因：** 各节点间的网络接口名称、IP 地址、DP rank 或 RPC 端口不一致。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:730
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Verify multi-node communication first. Ensure `HCCL_IF_IP`, "
"`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, and `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` match the"
" selected NIC. Ensure all nodes use the same `--data-parallel-rpc-port`, "
"non-master nodes use `--headless`, and `--data-parallel-start-rank` does not"
" overlap."
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 首先验证多节点通信。确保 `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME` "
"和 `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` 与所选网卡匹配。确保所有节点使用相同的 `--data-parallel-rpc-port`，非主节点使用"
" `--headless`，且 `--data-parallel-start-rank` 不重叠。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:732
msgid "Q3: Why is video disabled in the image-only examples?"
msgstr "Q3：为什么纯图像示例中禁用了视频？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:734
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** The service reserves more memory than expected, or startup "
"OOM occurs even when requests only contain images."
msgstr "**现象：** 服务预留的内存超出预期，或即使请求仅包含图像，启动时仍发生 OOM。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:736
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Allowing video inputs can reserve memory for long visual "
"embeddings and preprocessing paths that are not needed by image-only "
"workloads."
msgstr "**原因：** 允许视频输入可能会为长视觉嵌入和预处理路径预留内存，而这些对于纯图像工作负载并非必需。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:738
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Use `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0` for image-only serving. "
"Enable video only when your workload needs it, and lower `--max-model-len` "
"or request concurrency if needed."
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 对于纯图像服务，使用 `--limit-mm-per-prompt.video 0`。仅在工作负载需要时启用视频，并在必要时降低 "
"`--max-model-len` 或请求并发数。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:740
msgid "Q4: Why does enabling prefix caching not improve performance?"
msgstr "Q4：为什么启用前缀缓存没有提升性能？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:742
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** Prefix caching is enabled, but throughput or latency does "
"not improve."
msgstr "**现象：** 已启用前缀缓存，但吞吐量或延迟没有改善。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:744
msgid ""
"**Cause:** Prefix caching only helps when requests share reusable prefixes. "
"Random prompts, unique images, or low cache hit rates may add memory "
"pressure without visible gains."
msgstr "**原因：** 前缀缓存仅在请求共享可复用前缀时才有帮助。随机提示、独特图像或低缓存命中率可能会增加内存压力，而不会带来明显收益。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:746
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Enable prefix caching for repeated-prefix workloads. For "
"random benchmark datasets, memory-constrained long-context workloads, or PD "
"validation, compare with `--no-enable-prefix-caching`."
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** 对重复前缀的工作负载启用前缀缓存。对于随机基准数据集、内存受限的长上下文工作负载或PD验证，请与`--no-enable-"
"prefix-caching`进行比较。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:748
msgid "Q5: Why does PD disaggregation fail to transfer KV cache?"
msgstr "Q5：为什么PD分离架构无法传输KV缓存？"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:750
msgid ""
"**Phenomenon:** Requests reach the proxy or prefill service, but decode "
"nodes do not produce output or report KV transfer errors."
msgstr "**现象：** 请求到达代理或预填充服务，但解码节点未产生输出或报告KV传输错误。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:752
msgid ""
"**Cause:** The Mooncake connector ports, producer/consumer roles, or "
"`kv_connector_extra_config` DP/TP sizes do not match the actual topology."
msgstr ""
"**原因：** Mooncake连接器端口、生产者/消费者角色或`kv_connector_extra_config`的DP/TP大小与实际拓扑不匹配。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-VL-235B-A22B-Instruct.md:754
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Check `kv_role`, `kv_port`, and the prefill/decode DP/TP sizes"
" on all nodes. Start from the validated topology in Section 5.4, then change"
" one dimension at a time."
msgstr ""
"**解决方案：** "
"检查所有节点上的`kv_role`、`kv_port`以及预填充/解码的DP/TP大小。从第5.4节已验证的拓扑开始，然后每次只更改一个维度。"

#~ msgid "Run the following script to start online serving on one A3 node:"
#~ msgstr "运行以下脚本在单个A3节点上启动在线服务："
